[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_3_0_ROSE_OF_WILL]
Rose of Will

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_3_0_ROSE_OF_WILL_DESC]
We may lack powerful magic and machinery, but we do not lack the will to resist. If they want to pick our roses, let them be prepared to be pricked.

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_3_0_ROSE_OF_WILL_desc]


[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_3_0_ROSE_OF_WILL]
不屈蔷薇

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_3_0_ROSE_OF_WILL_DESC]
我们或许缺少强大的魔法和机械，但不缺少抵抗的意志。若他们想要摘走我们的玫瑰，就让他们做好被刺伤的准备。

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_3_0_ROSE_OF_WILL_desc]
